WEBVTT

00:00:52.150 --> 00:00:57.320
Hilander72
Ripped by

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:12.200
Lady Nei!

00:01:12.590 --> 00:01:13.570
Sheen?

00:01:13.760 --> 00:01:16.050
Yes, my lady!
It's about the messenger...

00:01:16.140 --> 00:01:18.350
...from the Meta-Rikana side
who brought the peace proposal.

00:01:18.610 --> 00:01:20.210
Kill him and send back the body!

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:24.930
Those who cross swords once
with Arshes Nei's 3rd army...

00:01:24.960 --> 00:01:27.950
...of the Four Lords of Havoc can
never be allowed to surrender!

00:01:29.070 --> 00:01:32.280
Have you forgotten
the iron laws of war?

00:01:34.210 --> 00:01:38.810
Either they survive by defeating
us or they all die in defeat!

00:01:38.840 --> 00:01:44.270
Lady Nei, allow me, Kai Harn,
to lead the attack on Meta-Rikana!

00:01:44.450 --> 00:01:45.630
As you wish.

00:01:45.990 --> 00:01:48.050
Ah! It would be my pleasure!

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:12.920
Darsh... Dark Schneider...

00:02:13.690 --> 00:02:16.930
The time has finally come
for me to kill you.

00:02:17.440 --> 00:02:21.060
Now that Ninja Master Gara
has deserted us, then I must...

00:02:21.090 --> 00:02:22.310
With my own hands...

00:02:42.940 --> 00:02:47.450
<i>What the?! This place!</i>
<i>Am I dreaming? No...</i>

00:02:50.380 --> 00:02:52.450
<i>I know this place...</i>

00:02:56.880 --> 00:03:00.170
Yes. It's where
you and I first met.

00:03:04.310 --> 00:03:05.260
Darsh!

00:03:05.610 --> 00:03:07.860
It's been a long time, Arshe.

00:03:10.630 --> 00:03:12.960
An illusion... Of course.

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:19.380
15 years haven't changed you.
Because of the elf blood in you.

00:03:19.410 --> 00:03:21.750
A Dark Elf's, right?

00:03:48.460 --> 00:03:50.390
On that day...

00:03:50.420 --> 00:03:52.490
...we began a hundred year love.

00:03:54.130 --> 00:03:55.480
However...

00:03:56.030 --> 00:03:57.530
Now we are enemies!

00:04:07.550 --> 00:04:12.070
Don't you understand, Nei?
Don't you realize...

00:04:12.210 --> 00:04:15.340
...who spent 100 years raising you
so you'd have this magnificent body?

00:04:16.460 --> 00:04:20.570
I love you. So, please...

00:04:20.600 --> 00:04:24.210
Don't stand against me!
Don't be my enemy!

00:04:24.690 --> 00:04:26.650
Am I clear, Arshe?

00:04:33.660 --> 00:04:37.770
<i>Darsh... Don't you see I...</i>
<i>I have no choice but to kill you.</i>

00:04:42.820 --> 00:04:43.950
Arshe!

00:04:45.150 --> 00:04:48.460
Darsh...
No, I mean Dark Schneider!

00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:52.510
Don't just assume I'm the same
person you knew 15 years ago.

00:04:52.830 --> 00:04:57.480
I am no longer the woman
you knew as Arshe. I am...

00:04:58.130 --> 00:05:01.500
I am Thunder Empress Arshes Nei,
one of the Four Lords of Havoc!

00:05:01.950 --> 00:05:03.650
Never forget that!

00:05:04.360 --> 00:05:07.230
Ji Elf Kiss.
Upon the altar I pledge...

00:05:07.260 --> 00:05:10.120
Th- That spell... Stop it!

00:05:10.210 --> 00:05:14.810
I command the spirits
and call down lightning...

00:05:15.790 --> 00:05:17.010
...to strike!

00:05:17.490 --> 00:05:18.180
TESLA!

00:05:32.040 --> 00:05:33.890
Lady Nei's tent!

00:05:34.240 --> 00:05:35.390
Lady Nei!

00:05:42.920 --> 00:05:46.000
<i>Darsh... Dark Schneider...</i>

00:05:56.040 --> 00:05:58.420
Hey, where's Yoko?

00:06:05.270 --> 00:06:08.760
<i>The fate of us in Meta-Rikana...</i>

00:06:08.790 --> 00:06:12.440
...now rests in the
hands of that dark wizard.

00:06:12.480 --> 00:06:14.560
Father! I'll find Rushe...

00:06:14.590 --> 00:06:17.390
I mean Dark Schneider,
no matter what!

00:06:17.480 --> 00:06:19.360
- <i>I'm counting on you, Yoko.</i>
- <i>Yes, Father!</i>

00:06:26.990 --> 00:06:29.630
You still haven't
located Dark Schneider?

00:06:29.930 --> 00:06:34.030
Correct. He lost us after contacting
Arshes Nei in that illusion.

00:06:34.340 --> 00:06:39.710
That half-elf loves Dark Schneider
more than if he were her own father.

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:43.700
Do you believe she
can kill Dark Schneider?

00:06:43.860 --> 00:06:46.880
Does she not
move as we wish her to?

00:06:47.020 --> 00:06:50.840
Thanks to the ceremony of
ancient evil, any betrayal by Nei...

00:06:50.870 --> 00:06:54.420
...will only result in
her own death.

00:06:54.620 --> 00:06:58.530
Moreover, they both have
exactly the same magical powers...

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:02.730
...and when they clash
then one of them...

00:07:02.760 --> 00:07:05.240
No, both of them most likely...

00:07:05.260 --> 00:07:08.790
...will be blasted
from the face of the Earth!

00:07:11.810 --> 00:07:13.760
I do hope this works...

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:24.100
No doubt about it.
This is Rushe's...

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:26.600
I mean Dark Schneider's handiwork.

00:07:27.350 --> 00:07:29.060
It still looks recently done.

00:07:29.320 --> 00:07:31.160
Yeah... Let's hurry.

00:07:48.040 --> 00:07:49.290
There we go!

00:07:50.240 --> 00:07:52.200
<i>Hey! Dark Schneider!</i>

00:07:52.310 --> 00:07:53.760
Hm? Who's there?

00:07:54.830 --> 00:07:57.370
Where are you looking?
Here! I'm over here!

00:07:58.470 --> 00:08:01.130
It's been 15 years,
Dark Schneider.

00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:02.700
Tha- That voice!

00:08:02.940 --> 00:08:04.130
Who is it?

00:08:05.160 --> 00:08:08.590
Lars! You know, Lars!
Don't you remember your old enemy?!

00:08:08.620 --> 00:08:11.650
Sheesh! I see you
still can't take a joke!

00:08:12.310 --> 00:08:15.360
So, you got punished by being
reincarnated as an animal, huh?

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:17.790
Oh, lay off!

00:08:17.840 --> 00:08:21.390
Anyway, you've made up with Gara
after you tried to kill him...

00:08:21.420 --> 00:08:23.690
...and you really seem
to care for that girl.

00:08:24.010 --> 00:08:27.820
Guess 15 years in limbo
can really change a guy.

00:08:30.830 --> 00:08:34.020
Hold it! Aren't you
going back to Meta-Rikana?

00:08:34.420 --> 00:08:36.800
Where are you going,
Dark Schneider?!

00:08:38.240 --> 00:08:40.630
<i>What're you up to,</i>
<i>Dark Schneider?</i>

00:08:49.180 --> 00:08:52.380
This mist... I'm getting
a bad feeling about this.

00:08:52.770 --> 00:08:56.340
We have holy
wards all around us.

00:08:56.510 --> 00:08:57.780
I don't think
anyone can spot us.

00:08:58.210 --> 00:09:02.070
But my intuition is usually right...
We'd better be careful.

00:09:14.910 --> 00:09:15.790
What the?!

00:09:21.390 --> 00:09:22.730
Why, you!

00:09:23.430 --> 00:09:24.960
Miss Yoko, watch yourself!

00:09:24.990 --> 00:09:26.140
Where's he coming from?!

00:09:30.220 --> 00:09:31.340
Behind us!

00:09:37.250 --> 00:09:38.240
No...

00:09:40.300 --> 00:09:41.660
This can't be...

00:09:49.690 --> 00:09:53.260
Miss Yoko! Save yourself!
Now, while you can!

00:09:53.430 --> 00:09:54.520
B- But!!

00:09:54.690 --> 00:09:57.870
You're vital to
Meta-Rikana's future...

00:09:58.080 --> 00:10:01.780
Live, and find Dark Schneider!

00:10:03.070 --> 00:10:04.030
Right!

00:10:12.390 --> 00:10:14.350
<i>All of you... Forgive me!</i>

00:10:45.490 --> 00:10:47.550
<i>It's no use! He'll catch</i>
<i>up with me eventually!</i>

00:10:47.890 --> 00:10:51.280
<i>Oh!</i>
<i>This is all Rushe's fault!</i>

00:10:52.150 --> 00:10:54.130
<i>Rushe! Help me!</i>

00:11:01.840 --> 00:11:04.920
Oh... NO!!!

00:11:30.590 --> 00:11:31.980
That was close.

00:12:14.380 --> 00:12:16.020
Huh? Yoko!

00:12:19.240 --> 00:12:20.790
R- Rushe!

00:12:28.150 --> 00:12:29.930
Pathetic. Totally pathetic!

00:12:30.420 --> 00:12:33.080
Is this the best
Meta-Rikana can do?!

00:12:33.230 --> 00:12:35.790
Is there not one person
in this entire kingdom...

00:12:35.820 --> 00:12:37.880
...who will face a
lone woman in combat?!

00:12:40.890 --> 00:12:44.060
I am Von Jobina, captain of the first
division of Meta-Rikana's knights!

00:12:44.190 --> 00:12:46.620
I seek single combat with you!

00:12:47.520 --> 00:12:50.010
How amusing.
Then I will face you...

00:12:50.040 --> 00:12:52.920
...with all the most powerful
techniques at my disposal!

00:12:53.230 --> 00:12:54.770
Just what I wanted!

00:12:57.630 --> 00:12:59.800
Ha Ri Ken sword
ultimate technique!

00:13:00.130 --> 00:13:02.270
Dragon strike death blow!

00:13:24.540 --> 00:13:28.760
<i>That monster's probably</i>
<i>still looking for us.</i>

00:13:29.580 --> 00:13:31.870
<i>I finally found Rushe...</i>

00:13:32.460 --> 00:13:34.900
<i>...but if we don't get out of</i>
<i>here, Meta-Rikana will be!</i>

00:13:40.580 --> 00:13:42.030
Who are you?!

00:13:43.610 --> 00:13:46.050
The most magnificent, the wisest...

00:13:46.080 --> 00:13:50.170
...the most beautiful, and the
most powerful count on Earth!

00:13:50.200 --> 00:13:52.620
The great Di Amon!

00:13:58.740 --> 00:14:01.850
Oh, how lovely!

00:14:01.980 --> 00:14:05.970
That body, not yet ripe,
is surely that of a virgin.

00:14:06.010 --> 00:14:07.940
Oh, this is
a night to remember.

00:14:07.980 --> 00:14:10.290
It is the night I
have Tia Note Yoko...

00:14:10.320 --> 00:14:12.800
...daughter of the great
priest Geo Note Soto...

00:14:13.290 --> 00:14:17.820
...as well as three
of his holy swordsmen...

00:14:18.720 --> 00:14:20.560
...and shall taste their blood.

00:14:20.590 --> 00:14:21.990
A vampire!

00:14:23.380 --> 00:14:28.400
Exactly. My magic power
will grow incredibly...

00:14:28.510 --> 00:14:32.540
...after I drink the fine
blood of virgins like yourselves.

00:14:32.570 --> 00:14:35.100
And also...

00:14:35.130 --> 00:14:37.710
...once I've killed the
mighty Dark Schneider...

00:14:38.720 --> 00:14:39.750
Rushe!

00:14:40.300 --> 00:14:45.420
...I will be an equal to both Lady Nei
and Lord Kall in name and fact!

00:14:45.450 --> 00:14:48.820
Now be a good girl and
let me drink your blood!

00:14:48.850 --> 00:14:53.050
If you do, you can
be eternally young...

00:14:53.080 --> 00:14:56.380
...and stay here like
these girls to serve me.

00:14:56.800 --> 00:14:59.520
Just shut your big,
fat mouth, vampire!

00:14:59.920 --> 00:15:02.620
Now that we know what
you really are, we've won!

00:15:03.960 --> 00:15:06.410
Holy God! In the name
of the sacred cross...

00:15:06.440 --> 00:15:08.400
...strike down this evil power!

00:15:08.580 --> 00:15:13.820
That's... The one thing in
the world vampires fear most!

00:15:20.000 --> 00:15:21.100
We did it!

00:15:21.390 --> 00:15:22.460
'Scuse me...

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:29.970
No, no, no, no!
That trick never works!

00:15:30.160 --> 00:15:31.660
Now, then, I'll start with you.

00:15:50.820 --> 00:15:55.160
Delicious!
And now, you're next.

00:15:55.290 --> 00:15:57.460
Right, right,
just be a good girl.

00:15:57.490 --> 00:15:58.770
Stop this!

00:15:59.910 --> 00:16:02.430
This is too cruel! Stop it!

00:16:02.460 --> 00:16:07.220
I'm begging you, please...
Stop this!

00:16:07.460 --> 00:16:10.330
You really are
a noisy young lady.

00:16:10.360 --> 00:16:14.010
I'll put the bite on you in a minute,
so just be quiet and wait.

00:16:14.180 --> 00:16:15.870
Like this girl here.

00:16:17.550 --> 00:16:18.800
Rushe!

00:16:18.850 --> 00:16:21.180
Please, wake up!

00:16:24.620 --> 00:16:26.050
If you don't do something...

00:16:26.770 --> 00:16:27.890
Then you...

00:16:28.580 --> 00:16:29.730
Then everyone...

00:16:31.160 --> 00:16:32.400
Everyone...

00:16:33.760 --> 00:16:35.790
Everyone will be killed!

00:16:38.420 --> 00:16:40.430
What the hell?!

00:16:42.070 --> 00:16:47.300
What the hell is this crap?!
Isn't she a virgin?!

00:16:49.080 --> 00:16:52.860
Isn't she a holy
swordsman of the gods?!

00:16:55.300 --> 00:16:58.890
Good grief,
young girls these days...

00:16:59.150 --> 00:17:02.160
Now I need some blood from the
best-quality virgin here...

00:17:02.190 --> 00:17:05.020
...just to wash the bad
taste out of my mouth!

00:17:05.230 --> 00:17:06.440
Rushe!

00:17:08.990 --> 00:17:11.680
It's no use, you see.

00:17:12.140 --> 00:17:15.840
No matter how much you call him,
Dark Schneider isn't going to revive.

00:17:17.210 --> 00:17:18.530
Rushe!

00:17:19.610 --> 00:17:22.750
Please, help me! RUSHE!!!

00:17:29.220 --> 00:17:31.210
Let me out!!!

00:17:31.530 --> 00:17:32.750
Rushe!

00:17:32.780 --> 00:17:35.920
Impossible! He's trying to
break the seal by himself?!

00:17:36.590 --> 00:17:39.420
Let me out of here!!!

00:17:40.260 --> 00:17:42.080
Yoko!

00:17:43.320 --> 00:17:47.840
Yoko, I'm scared!
I feel like I'm gonna pop!

00:17:47.970 --> 00:17:51.910
Let me out! I'll kill
anyone who hurts Yoko!

00:17:51.940 --> 00:17:54.600
It can't be...
Both their minds are together...

00:17:54.940 --> 00:17:56.280
I'm scared!

00:17:56.310 --> 00:17:57.200
Let me...

00:17:57.250 --> 00:17:58.840
Yoko!

00:17:58.870 --> 00:17:59.870
...out of here!

00:18:00.010 --> 00:18:02.770
Yoko, help me!

00:18:02.800 --> 00:18:07.010
It won't work. Rushe's
personality and the seal...

00:18:07.040 --> 00:18:09.270
...are stronger
than Dark Schneider.

00:18:11.040 --> 00:18:13.530
Surprise, surprise, my little prize!

00:18:18.670 --> 00:18:20.070
I hit him...

00:18:20.100 --> 00:18:21.610
You hit me...

00:18:22.170 --> 00:18:25.210
You little brat! You dare
kick a nobleman's face?!

00:18:25.240 --> 00:18:26.870
I'll pay you
back ten times over!

00:18:28.180 --> 00:18:30.360
Take this!

00:18:50.830 --> 00:18:51.850
Impossible!

00:18:54.780 --> 00:18:56.050
Rushe...

00:18:56.260 --> 00:18:58.460
D- Dark Schneider...

00:18:59.130 --> 00:19:01.980
Of all the women in the world...

00:19:02.320 --> 00:19:05.480
...you went and kicked MY Yoko?!

00:19:05.940 --> 00:19:07.760
Is this clear?!
She's important to me...

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:11.080
...because she will
bear my children one day!

00:19:11.910 --> 00:19:13.810
Hey! I get a say in this, too!

00:19:13.970 --> 00:19:16.540
You ugly pile of meat!

00:19:16.570 --> 00:19:20.250
Su An Doa Stay-ru...
Die, monkey-boy!

00:19:20.460 --> 00:19:22.060
RIOT!

00:19:27.290 --> 00:19:28.490
Got him!

00:19:34.310 --> 00:19:37.380
This is the great power
of Dark Schneider?!

00:19:37.410 --> 00:19:40.320
The power of the legendary
wizard I've heard about?! Amazing!

00:19:40.350 --> 00:19:43.010
If that's the best you can do,
I just have to laugh!

00:19:48.620 --> 00:19:51.980
I don't like you. I don't like
how you look down on people.

00:19:52.280 --> 00:19:55.330
How your eyes say " No one as
wonderful as me could ever lose!"

00:19:55.360 --> 00:19:58.520
You think that you're the
most powerful man in the world?!

00:19:58.550 --> 00:20:01.340
Yeah. I'm the most
powerful man in the world.

00:20:01.370 --> 00:20:05.380
Oh, I can't allow that! That
attitude of total fearlessness.

00:20:05.410 --> 00:20:09.800
I'm gonna have to teach you
once what the word "fear" means!

00:20:10.410 --> 00:20:12.830
Don't bother, monkey-boy.
It won't work.

00:20:13.380 --> 00:20:15.710
Now behold the
power of a vampire!

00:20:17.750 --> 00:20:20.050
There he goes!
The count's killer move!

00:20:20.180 --> 00:20:22.010
ASSASSIN!

00:20:24.260 --> 00:20:25.340
Rushe!

00:20:28.130 --> 00:20:31.590
I've done it!
I've killed Dark Schneider!

00:20:36.630 --> 00:20:37.350
HUH?!!

00:20:38.370 --> 00:20:39.380
Rushe!

00:20:39.410 --> 00:20:42.350
Im- Impossible...
I know I hit you!

00:20:44.810 --> 00:20:47.000
Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-What?!

00:20:48.730 --> 00:20:50.060
Don't you realize that
lightning spell I used before...

00:20:50.090 --> 00:20:52.980
...has screwed up
your nervous system?!

00:20:53.010 --> 00:20:54.830
You idiot!

00:20:54.860 --> 00:20:59.080
There's no way you can
use your magic properly now!

00:21:00.930 --> 00:21:04.250
Damn you... You insult
a gentleman?!

00:21:04.490 --> 00:21:08.770
I don't care if I have no
sense of direction! Try this!

00:21:08.800 --> 00:21:12.070
The Di Amon Mega
Rotation Assassin!

00:21:20.970 --> 00:21:24.230
Can you escape my spell?!

00:21:30.390 --> 00:21:33.830
In battles between men,
there is one, unchanging rule:

00:21:34.320 --> 00:21:38.380
The ugly, macho guy
absolutely can never defeat...

00:21:38.410 --> 00:21:43.080
...the smart, handsome,
popular main character!

00:21:43.330 --> 00:21:46.900
The minute you showed up with that
face, your death was inevitable!

00:21:46.930 --> 00:21:49.680
Sh- Shut up! I'm beautiful!

00:21:49.950 --> 00:21:53.800
Let's go, monster! I'll pay you
back for Yoko a hundred times over!

00:22:00.830 --> 00:22:03.380
You fool!
You missed me by a mile!

00:22:10.000 --> 00:22:12.140
Daybreak!

00:22:15.900 --> 00:22:22.530
Idiot. There's only one person
who can make me feel fear.

00:22:29.770 --> 00:22:33.920
Don't forget that a vampire's
body is nearly indestructible!

00:22:34.260 --> 00:22:39.200
I am a nobleman! I am a
conqueror! I am a ruler!

00:22:39.230 --> 00:22:42.110
My name is Count Di Amon!

00:22:46.360 --> 00:22:47.820
Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:22:49.750 --> 00:22:53.050
Even after a vampire's body is
burned to ashes by the sunlight...

00:22:53.080 --> 00:22:57.830
...his spirit appears as a bat
and he'll one day revive, right?

00:22:58.910 --> 00:23:01.360
Are...
Are you going to kill me?!

00:23:04.550 --> 00:23:07.330
Let's cast a spell
with a piece of bat skin.

00:23:08.840 --> 00:23:10.160
St- Stop!

00:23:10.440 --> 00:23:13.580
Di Amon, it would be sort
of a shame to kill you.

00:23:13.690 --> 00:23:16.950
You're an evil, tough, arrogant,
cruel, and genuinely amusing guy.

00:23:17.570 --> 00:23:20.580
So, I'll give you a chance to
decide whether you'll live or die.

00:23:21.020 --> 00:23:23.310
Ki Obos Plataro,
king of the demonic night...

00:23:23.340 --> 00:23:25.840
...who flies to
me upon bat wings.

00:23:25.870 --> 00:23:29.330
Possess my nail
and seal this contract.

00:23:30.080 --> 00:23:32.260
This blue fingernail
will enter your body...

00:23:32.290 --> 00:23:34.380
...with the spell and
become a part of you.

00:23:34.780 --> 00:23:39.330
If you disobey me, it will change
to purple and gradually grow redder.

00:23:39.950 --> 00:23:43.280
If it ever turns crimson,
that's it for you!

00:23:43.310 --> 00:23:47.400
Your body will fall apart and
all that will be left...

00:23:49.000 --> 00:23:51.880
...will be a pathetic toad!

00:23:52.090 --> 00:23:55.810
No! Stop!
If you have any mercy...

00:23:56.340 --> 00:23:58.060
Which I don't.

00:23:59.640 --> 00:24:01.630
ACCUSED!

00:24:04.640 --> 00:24:08.510
Don't forget! If you don't
obey me, you'll turn into a toad!

00:24:09.070 --> 00:24:11.700
Whew! Well, glad THAT'S over.

00:24:19.390 --> 00:24:21.440
The three of
them did this for me...

00:24:26.000 --> 00:24:29.750
Relax, Yoko. If we treat
them soon, they'll recover.

00:24:30.000 --> 00:24:32.150
Really?! Thank goodness!

00:24:34.610 --> 00:24:37.190
More than that,
I'm worried about you, Yoko.

00:24:39.190 --> 00:24:42.860
- I'm fine, really!
- But you're bleeding, aren't you?

00:24:44.220 --> 00:24:46.860
Hey! Cut it out!
I said no!

00:24:46.890 --> 00:24:48.670
We don't have time for this.

00:24:49.360 --> 00:24:50.510
Don't!

00:24:50.820 --> 00:24:53.080
I said we don't
have time for this!

00:24:53.560 --> 00:24:55.780
Come on, we have to
get back to Meta-Rikana!

00:24:55.940 --> 00:24:57.290
Right, right...

00:24:59.830 --> 00:25:04.460
So, Arshes Nei's forces
have reached this far.

00:25:06.290 --> 00:25:10.140
Yoko, haven't you found
Dark Schneider yet?

00:25:13.650 --> 00:25:15.640
How does it look, old woman?

00:25:18.590 --> 00:25:20.440
This vision I see...

00:25:20.540 --> 00:25:21.890
What?! What the?!

00:25:22.970 --> 00:25:24.200
How can this be?!

00:25:24.960 --> 00:25:30.780
Dark Schneider lying dead,
his heart torn out!

00:25:37.440 --> 00:25:38.540
Lady Nei!

00:26:22.750 --> 00:26:23.840
That was!

00:26:25.030 --> 00:26:27.020
The forbidden spell of
ultimate destruction...

00:26:27.050 --> 00:26:28.140
HARROWING!

00:26:29.990 --> 00:26:32.410
<i>The ancient spell, Harrowing.</i>

00:26:32.990 --> 00:26:35.540
<i>Only one man can cast the spell</i>
<i>of ultimate destruction...</i>

00:26:36.760 --> 00:26:42.050
<i>You've come, Darsh!</i>
<i>No... Dark Schneider!</i>

00:29:47.470 --> 00:29:51.610
Darsh... No, you are the man who
stands in the way of my dream...

00:29:51.720 --> 00:29:53.040
Dark Schneider!

00:29:53.660 --> 00:29:57.030
Thunder Empress Arshes Nei
will kill you with...

00:29:57.060 --> 00:30:00.910
...the Blade of the Thunder God,
even if it costs me my life!
